sequenceDiagram
    participant H as Hub / mock
    participant S as Solver
    participant V as Source
    participant D as DeliveryAccount
    participant R as Recipient
    Note over S: FUTURE recheck
    S->>V: Fresh quote / bounded swap
    V-->>S: Output tokens
    S->>D: Separate payout
    D-->>R: Agreed payout
    H->>S: Delivery receipt
    S->>H: Verified acknowledgment
